# VFS Data Path Critical Bug Fix Sprint

**Sprint Goal**: Fix critical VFS data consistency bugs that prevent category clicks from correctly filtering products.

**Target State**: 
- All 22 catalogue leaf categories resolve to correct product sets
- slotMetadataMap contains ALL tree nodes (headers AND links)
- unrollDescendantKeys handles missing IDs gracefully
- Comprehensive regression tests prevent future data path failures

**Deadline**: 12:00 (2 hours)

---

## Scope Contract 1: Fix slotMetadataMap Generation (CRITICAL)

**Objective**: Fix `scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs` to include ALL nodes in slotMetadataMap, not just headers with children.

**Regression Risk Areas**:
- `data/catalogue-index.json` (regenerated output)
- `data/catalogue.ts` (consumes slotMetadataMap)
- `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` (uses unrollDescendantKeys)
- `app/(store)/products/page.tsx` (uses catalogue functions)

**Allowed Write Paths**:
- `scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs` (lines 100-120)
- `tests/build/catalogue-index-generation.test.ts` (new file)

**Forbidden Actions**:
- Do NOT modify data/catalogue-index.json manually (must be regenerated)
- Do NOT change slugToIdMap structure
- Do NOT change tree structure
- Do NOT modify any component files yet

**Verification Command**:
```bash
cd c:\webdev\sang-logium
node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs
npm run build && npx tsc --noEmit
```

### DoD Layer 1.1: Regression Tests (FIRST - Contain Risk)
- [ ] Create `tests/build/catalogue-index-generation.test.ts`
- [ ] Test: Verify all tree IDs exist in slotMetadataMap
- [ ] Test: Verify leaf nodes have slotMetadataMap entries
- [ ] Test: Verify parent-child references are valid
- [ ] Test: Verify slugToIdMap contains only leaf slugs
- [ ] Run tests: `npm run test:build` (expect current failures)

### DoD Layer 1.2: Fix Build Script
- [ ] Modify `buildCatalogueIndex()` in build-catalogue-index.mjs
- [ ] Change slotMetadataMap population to include ALL nodes
- [ ] Add metadata fields: id, children, hasChildren, slug, type
- [ ] Run build script: `node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs`
- [ ] Verify catalogue-index.json regenerated without errors

### DoD Layer 1.3: Data Integrity Verification
- [ ] Load regenerated `data/catalogue-index.json`
- [ ] Verify all 22 leaf nodes exist in slotMetadataMap
- [ ] Verify all header nodes exist in slotMetadataMap
- [ ] Verify parent-child references are intact
- [ ] Run regression tests: `npm run test:build` (expect all passing)

### DoD Layer 1.4: System Verification
- [ ] Run build: `npm run build` (must pass)
- [ ] Run type check: `npx tsc --noEmit` (must pass)
- [ ] Verify no console errors
- [ ] Verify no data corruption in output

