## Scope Contract 2: Fix unrollDescendantKeys (CRITICAL)

**Objective**: Fix `data/catalogue.ts` to handle missing IDs in slotMetadataMap gracefully (treat as leaf nodes).

**Regression Risk Areas**:
- `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` (calls unrollDescendantKeys)
- `app/(store)/products/page.tsx` (calls catalogue functions)
- All category pages that depend on catalogue key resolution

**Allowed Write Paths**:
- `data/catalogue.ts` (unrollDescendantKeys function)
- `tests/unit/vfs/unrollDescendantKeys.test.ts` (new file)

**Forbidden Actions**:
- Do NOT modify resolveSlugToId
- Do NOT modify slugToIdMap usage
- Do NOT change function signature
- Do NOT modify any UI components

**Verification Command**:
```bash
cd c:\webdev\sang-logium
npm run test:unit -- tests/unit/vfs/
npm run build && npx tsc --noEmit
```

### DoD Layer 2.1: Regression Tests (FIRST - Contain Risk)
- [ ] Create `tests/unit/vfs/unrollDescendantKeys.test.ts`
- [ ] Test: Returns [id] for leaf nodes (no children)
- [ ] Test: Returns [id, ...descendants] for nodes with children
- [ ] Test: Handles missing ID in slotMetadataMap (returns [id])
- [ ] Test: Handles circular references gracefully
- [ ] Run tests: `npm run test:unit -- tests/unit/vfs/` (expect current failures)

### DoD Layer 2.2: Implement Fix
- [ ] Modify `unrollDescendantKeys()` in data/catalogue.ts
- [ ] Add early return: if (!slot) return [rootId]
- [ ] Add warning log for missing IDs (development only)
- [ ] Verify recursion still works for valid trees
- [ ] Run unit tests: `npm run test:unit -- tests/unit/vfs/` (expect passing)

### DoD Layer 2.3: Integration Verification
- [ ] Test slug → ID → keys flow with real catalogue-index.json
- [ ] Test: "open-back" → ID → keys includes leaf ID
- [ ] Test: "headphones" (header) → ID → keys includes all children
- [ ] Test: invalid slug → null → empty keys
- [ ] Run integration tests: `npm run test:integration`

### DoD Layer 2.4: System Verification
- [ ] Run build: `npm run build` (must pass)
- [ ] Run type check: `npx tsc --noEmit` (must pass)
- [ ] Clear cache: `Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .next`
- [ ] Restart dev server: `npm run dev`
- [ ] Verify no runtime errors

