**Development**:
```bash
# Clear cache and restart
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .next
npm run dev

# Run tests
npm run test:unit
npm run test:integration
npm run test:e2e

# Build
npm run build
npx tsc --noEmit
```

**Data Regeneration**:
```bash
node scripts/build-catalogue-index.mjs
```

